{
  "id": "39",
  "title": "女命富贵贫贱篇",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“女命富贵贫贱篇”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "欲推女命，先看官星；官带杀而贫贱，官得令以安荣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-5b76cbac1e07736ad79f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官太重必妨夫，且是为人性重。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-0324b2b40bf446558fd6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "倒食重逢须减福，那堪更犯孤辰。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-dd34e3884b840f64b4b5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀重须奔贵室。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-446b11d4882fa63b270a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "合多定损贞名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-afd880f336e7953e2e8a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "坐禄乘舆而稳厚。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-c0ffa1a4c6fe304b5548-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "冲身动步以轻浮。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-a05c8f756a0cdb9acfce-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若乃桃花浪滚，淫奔之耻不堪言。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-aacb3c1b88e1616b5876-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日禄归时，贵重为人所敬。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-520f684bd08b61677bb1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天月二德以坐本命，如逢印綬，贵当两国之封。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-6edf780ee57d6b5ea8f8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时日阳刃，本是凶神，既不利于夫主之宫，兼损坏乎平生之性。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-687bc60ed902630b673b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身干主禎祥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-4beab944ccc2bced9403-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时犯食神健旺，要观八字之强；专食子荣，忌偏印窃身之胜。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-63b0b1f5cf7171701f95-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "守闺门而正静，必由阴日守中和。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-358c1731ebc220046086-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "待夫婿以经营，此乃阳干时旺甚。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-6d67b1f3096c847d5923-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大抵，欣逢正禄。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-b96de403eeee72af4abc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "怕犯咸池。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-91be22d3a90c2c50af60-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "清贵得长生之辅。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-40303607fca1d177425c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杂浊以败气之归。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-967b2d04c93cc823ba13-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱败多，大忌冲身而犯合。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-61c6237490c5aee32438-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "一生忙甚，若非是妓即为尼。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-4bcf159fed20c56fdf0d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印坏与公姑相妒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-4cfca6caefdfa5f421b7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食专得子嗣之宜。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-a8a9c35c1c77a7ab8105-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀重逢，须防淫乱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-db1483c8d0b49fbbd5cf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "姊妹透出，便见争夫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-c8989afcd3eade5d4d1b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "魁罡有灵变之机。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-0f70b56116f733965de7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日贵有安常之福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-9dd946b9ac2151e76774-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "即以干支分定，官杀胜而无制伏，不为娼妓，定作尼姑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "39-2650a746b444e8976f90-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
